1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,800
Every PC advisor answers the same way: buy more.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:11,500
MOTTAINAI — Japanese for the regret of letting
something still useful go to waste.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,500
This agent looks for reasons you do NOT need to spend.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,500
You describe the machine you already own,
and what you actually do with it.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:32,000
A fleet fans out. Reading the hardware and reading
the workload happen at the same time.

6
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Then the verdict is computed.
Not by a model — by ordinary, tested code.

7
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:45,500
The CPU and the memory are already far beyond
what this work needs.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,800
The graphics card is not something to buy at all.

9
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,300
Windows 11 is free — it is a BIOS setting.
Only the drive is short: 9,990 yen.
